    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fdc2c35904e9d974e059e38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，真不愧是你们。\n今天听你们讲了很多，\n全都很有参考价值！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70ce05ae6351f04b2cd6580f17ca0ff85d3e9fc60c7f9444bc0c7767fbc25098",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cafaded6f5eb97e84149af9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我的搭档生野狄杜斯，\n平安无事地跑完了3年的比赛\n其管理技术受到了广大好评――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae2275ab10ae26a56ec6861c8f857b890fa21c066816e907a4bfeda28bd585e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:501975a2c239854e5e3d0148",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，眼前这位URA职员，\n主管特雷森学园强化部门的\n佐岳五月小姐也来找我们商量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da82eb5bec9509002462889104930186b188777a1b9aee3327626bf9e09eef78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3427ca12327a3f3534b98c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她好像还负责一个支援日本赛马娘\n海外远征的团队――",
      "source_fingerprint": "5923db9ec52f12cf23e02a7b91f82ddb6b8bbff43f2923e02a9a88b5de64b2fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a2e1b149d576333dc199a6e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说是希望生野狄杜斯与我的管理技术，\n能积极应用在今后的海外远征中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c44d7268556bd9670a7e232229df61e2a751cd0f9209da74f378d5c592f3936d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
