    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52ec628281eecaa2d8303f8a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与生野狄杜斯最初的3年结束了。\n但，这只不过是一个开始――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7ec071af82c33b23b5e397bc4642a44d3d7dbbb05b342bcc8d8ea7b2dada338",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed47d7c2d7e5a6c43a82dc1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『跑得比任何人都遥远』，她的蹄跡，\n今后也会继续延伸下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1d644dcce2630a2da1326a7dbc8a59e333ec3562c645ac22f1a674440b06429",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c647cea8538bd01f90ee5287",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以此来助力――\n创造一个比赛谁也不会受伤的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f19539835a473c1adcbfc13b84e9db434105fdb92b193be4493e016d08badeb8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
