      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……那好！\n我们会公开『IRON WILL』的全部数据，\n将其分享给大众！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb5b0afeaf6d536ab107ff0ea3bd6b69e9f33a917894e4ff946ce18ed9e1461",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
