    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f48ac2510c5db258eb3d1ab5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，期盼！　这份“意志”，\n能为所有赛马娘以及相关人员们，\n创造一个更美好的未来！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a6b3584359ccd1563a140f5a60876f31728db979d509fc0a117146467de6657",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c7a1bea7b3662fc153c53a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是『IRON WILL』，\n以及自己总结了其应用方法的资料――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8ed1fa2c3e7c91972393fde533825d85d28ce73bd935d9fa7879e0dfe2be798",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a0f222be44d9eb1fd4c632",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还有『IRON WILL』记录的\n我与生野狄杜斯3年来走过的路程，\n大规模地向大众公开了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bdab2c87ff4ffb5d64fce3ae00b21d5cc13d5747f416abcc0f9510e2ee7fc2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc699e235f22db91d6749ec7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后其知名度的扩大，\n超出了自己的预期――",
      "source_fingerprint": "69b262f51d0f812dd66a52473c2fe234fa81107e4f42d93d6d8aa9ad1034e66d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
